  SLI["SLI: good events over valid events, per minute"] --> ER["Error ratio over the long window"]
  SLI --> ES["Error ratio over the short window"]
  ER --> BL["Burn rate = error ratio / (1 - SLO)"]
  ES --> BS["Burn rate = error ratio / (1 - SLO)"]
